    a tutorial artifact that teaches tension management.

The player starts with an artifact that can drain tension once, then must recharge in sanctuary. This gives them a safety net while learning, but doesn't remove the core tension loop.
Tutorial	Shattered Mirror	One-time tension drain (-0.3)	Reach first ruin
Early Game	Burnt Journal	Reveals prediction field (P_sys hotspots)	Avoid stalker ambushes
Mid Game	Broken Compass	Aligns movement to memory gradient (M_avg)	Find resource-rich areas
Late Game	Empty Locket	Creates safe zone (temporary sanctuary)	Deep exploration
End Game	Fractured Crown	Injects tension into T_sys (sacrifice for power)	Trigger rupture on demand


